<div id="spm-root" class="spm-root" data-spm-cluster-id="{{clusterId}}" data-spm-version="{{version}}">
	<div class="spm-toolbar">
		<span class="spm-summary" aria-live="polite"></span>
		<span class="spm-updated"></span>
		<button type="button" class="btn btn-link spm-reload">Reload</button>
	</div>
	<div class="spm-message" role="status">Loading path states…</div>
	<div class="spm-orphans" hidden>
		<h5>Mounts without a data store</h5>
		<p>These GFS2 file systems are mounted on a host, but Morpheus has no data store for them, for example because
			unmounting failed when the data store was removed.</p>
		<table class="table table-condensed">
			<thead>
				<tr>
					<th>Host</th>
					<th>Device</th>
					<th>Mount point</th>
					<th>Withdrawn</th>
					<th>Since</th>
				</tr>
			</thead>
			<tbody></tbody>
		</table>
	</div>
	<table class="table spm-table" hidden>
		<thead>
			<tr>
				<th class="spm-col-toggle"><span class="sr-only">Details</span></th>
				<th>Data Store</th>
				<th>State</th>
				<th>Hosts</th>
			</tr>
		</thead>
		<tbody></tbody>
	</table>
	<p class="spm-note">Paths and mounts per host are measured in the background (interval <span class="spm-interval">–</span> s).
		<em>degraded</em>: not all paths active, or fewer paths than the other hosts; for the cluster also a mount without a
		data store. <em>down</em>: no path active, LUN missing, not mounted, file system withdrawn or storage pool not active. <em>unknown</em>: host
		not measured or not reachable, or a check failed.</p>
	<p class="spm-about">Storage Path Monitor {{version}} · Author: {{author}} · License: {{license}} ·
		<a href="{{repositoryUrl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source code</a></p>
</div>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{asset '/storage-path-monitor.css'}}?v={{assetVersion}}">
<script src="{{asset '/storage-path-monitor.js'}}?v={{assetVersion}}" nonce="{{nonce ''}}"></script>
